    "storage": {
      "value": "<h2>How to resolve OpenERP error &quot;There is no period defined&quot;&nbsp;</h2><p>OpenERP is throwing this error because there are no periods defined in the system for this date. This usually happens when the year changes. Users will get the below error message when confirming the sales quotation.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:border=\"true\" ac:title=\"Error message\" ac:alt=\"Error message\" ac:height=\"400\" ac:width=\"748\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"image2017-1-2_12-19-40.png\" /></ac:image></p><p style=\"margin-left: 90.0px;text-align: center;\"><strong>Error message shown while confirming the quotation.</strong></p><h2><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Steps</span></h2><p><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">1. Log in to OpenERP with Admin level privilege account.</span></strong></p><p><strong>2.&nbsp;Navigate to &ldquo;Accounting&rdquo; tab. Click on the option &ldquo;Periods&rdquo; under &ldquo;Configuration&rdquo; from the left panel.</strong></p><p><strong><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:title=\"Navigate to Periods\" ac:thumbnail=\"true\" ac:alt=\"Navigate to Periods\" ac:height=\"250\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"image2017-1-2_12-24-52.png\" /></ac:image></strong></p><p><strong>3. Click on the &ldquo;Fiscal Years&rdquo; option.</strong></p><p><strong><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:title=\"Fiscal years\" ac:thumbnail=\"true\" ac:alt=\"Fiscal years\" ac:height=\"150\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"image2017-1-2_12-25-46.png\" /></ac:image></strong></p><p><strong>4. Click on &ldquo;Create&rdquo; button. Define the fiscal year as shown in the example below.</strong></p><p><strong><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:title=\"Create a fiscal year\" ac:alt=\"Create a fiscal year\" ac:height=\"250\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"image2017-1-2_12-27-8.png\" /></ac:image></strong></p><p><strong>6. Click on &ldquo;Create Monthly Periods&rdquo; and it will generate the periods as shown below.</strong></p><p><strong><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:title=\"Create monthly periods\" ac:alt=\"Create monthly periods\" ac:height=\"400\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"image2017-1-2_12-28-30.png\" /></ac:image></strong></p><p><strong>7.&nbsp;Click on &ldquo;Save&rdquo; button to save the periods and fiscal year. There should not be any error now while confirming the quotations.</strong></p><p><br /></p>",
